sequenceDiagram
    participant ODH as opendatahub-operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AIGW as ai-gateway-operator<br/>8081/TCP health, 8443/TCP metrics
    participant BatchGW as batch-gateway-operator
    participant MaaS as maas-controller
    participant AIGWCtrl as ai-gateway-controller

    Note over ODH,K8s: Flow 1: AIGateway CR Reconciliation

    ODH->>K8s: Create/Update AIGateway CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>AIGW: Watch event: AIGateway changed<br/>TLS 1.2+
    AIGW->>AIGW: Read spec.batchGateway.managementState<br/>Read spec.modelsAsAService.managementState
    alt batchGateway: Managed
        AIGW->>K8s: SSA deploy batch-gateway-operator manifests<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>BatchGW: Sub-component deployed
    end
    alt modelsAsAService: Managed
        AIGW->>K8s: SSA deploy maas-controller manifests<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>MaaS: Sub-component deployed
        AIGW->>K8s: SSA deploy ai-gateway-controller manifests<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>AIGWCtrl: Sub-component deployed
    end
    AIGW->>K8s: Patch AIGateway CR status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over ODH,K8s: Flow 2: Platform Version Handshake

    ODH->>K8s: Update ConfigMap odh-aigateway-config
    K8s-->>AIGW: Watch event: ConfigMap changed
    AIGW->>AIGW: Compare platform version
    AIGW->>K8s: Update AIGateway status.releases<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over MaaS,AIGW: Flow 3: MaaS Health Aggregation

    MaaS->>K8s: Update Config CR status.conditions
    AIGW->>K8s: GET Config CR (unstructured)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>AIGW: Config CR with conditions
    AIGW->>K8s: Patch AIGateway CR conditions<br/>(ModelsAsAServiceReady, TenantsHealthy)
    K8s-->>ODH: Watch: AIGateway status updated
    ODH->>K8s: Update DataScienceCluster status
